New Polls feature available in Microsoft Teams
https://click.mail.onedrive.com/?qs=925c70573ecaa9453e27dccf0135dd24cbc93e27fddfdb0becd1c240288f426334e849b5015e6eee3092d0b357628e3e5a1e75f6f46685fc 

Try creating your first poll
 

https://click.mail.onedrive.com/?qs=925c70573ecaa9453f136aa6de4f51ef3c8d13b1eb8abed72c6b74d9294a08f6271f93f256731a65180089b486966c5223e6ce76ac4350d6 

  
 


 
 Make group decisions with instant polls
 
 

 Create instant polls and see results directly in chats so that everyone’s voice is heard. Get to agreement easier on when to meet or what to order for dinner. Polls is now available for everyone to use in Microsoft Teams.
 

 
 Group decisions as easy as 1, 2, 3
 
 

 <strong>Step 1.</strong> Go to the group chat where you want to create the poll.
 

 <strong>Step 2. </strong>Tap <strong>Polls</strong> button  under the Type a message field.
 

 <strong>Step 3.</strong> Enter your question and options. Then tap <strong>Save</strong> to see a preview of your poll.
 

